<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1487501535"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1534998916"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="春夢"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="May'n"/><amll:meta key="album" value="15Colors -nu skool-"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:46.368"><div begin="00:08.493" end="03:19.637"><p begin="00:08.493" end="00:14.029" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">誉れ誉れと咲く花散る頃に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">姹紫嫣红盛放的花飘散之时</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho ma re ho ma re to sa ku ha na chi ru ko ro ni</span></p><p begin="00:14.405" end="00:16.284" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">貴方が歌う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你唱起歌谣</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta ga u ta u</span></p><p begin="00:17.531" end="00:21.496" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">桜色、想いの果てに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">樱色浸染的记忆之中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa ku ra i ro o mo i no ha te ni</span></p><p begin="00:21.947" end="00:25.639" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">息はもつれていった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呼吸交缠相融</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ki wa mo tsu re te i 't ta</span></p><p begin="00:26.536" end="00:28.398" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">溺れそうだった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">浓稠寂寞</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o bo re so u da 't ta</span></p><p begin="00:28.764" end="00:30.641" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">寂しかったんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">教我窒息</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa bi shi ka 't ta n da</span></p><p begin="00:31.038" end="00:32.851" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">溢れそうだった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱意澎湃</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a fu re so u da 't ta</span></p><p begin="00:33.301" end="00:35.146" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">愛しかったんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">汹涌难抑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i to shi ka 't ta n da</span></p><p begin="00:35.537" end="00:39.695" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">時を超えて形となり<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">超越时空 化为实体</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ki wo ko e te ka ta chi to na ri</span></p><p begin="00:40.143" end="00:43.533" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">私は沈む<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">令我深深沉没</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi wa shi zu mu</span></p><p begin="00:45.534" end="00:47.348" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">何千何万回だって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">成千上万次</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n ze n na n ma n ka i da 't te</span></p><p begin="00:47.794" end="00:49.622" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">貴方の髪が揺れてるんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的发随风摇摆</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta no ka mi ga yu re te ru n da</span></p><p begin="00:49.981" end="00:51.910" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">何千何万回だって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">成千上万次</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n ze n na n ma n ka i da 't te</span></p><p begin="00:52.232" end="00:54.159" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">貴方は待ってやくれないや<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你都不曾等待我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta wa ma 't te ya ku re na i ya</span></p><p begin="00:54.516" end="00:57.961" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">水平線の上からまた明日<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">立于水平线上道别 明天见</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su i he i se n no u e ka ra ma ta a shi ta</span></p><p begin="00:58.556" end="01:01.864" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">ええ約束よ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嗯 约好了哦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">e e ya ku so ku yo</span></p><p begin="01:11.859" end="01:13.705" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">失くしそうだった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">害怕失去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ku shi so u da 't ta</span></p><p begin="01:14.083" end="01:15.963" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">悲しかったんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">满心悲伤</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka na shi ka 't ta n da</span></p><p begin="01:16.329" end="01:18.126" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">届きそうだった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仿若可及</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to do ki so u da 't ta</span></p><p begin="01:18.587" end="01:20.416" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">離していたんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却又远离</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha na shi te i ta n da</span></p><p begin="01:20.860" end="01:28.448" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">海の底に流れ着いた宝物たち<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">珍贵宝物随洋流漂到了海底</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u mi no so ko ni na ga re tsu i ta ta ka ra mo no ta chi</span></p><p begin="01:30.793" end="01:32.589" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">何千何万回だって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">成千上万次</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n ze n na n ma n ka i da 't te</span></p><p begin="01:33.041" end="01:34.871" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">貴方の声が聞こえるんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我都能听见你的声音</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta no ko e ga ki ko e ru n da</span></p><p begin="01:35.238" end="01:37.121" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">何千何万回だって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">成千上万次</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n ze n na n ma n ka i da 't te</span></p><p begin="01:37.564" end="01:39.459" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">貴方の瞳になりたいな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我都想成为你的眼睛</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta no hi to mi ni na ri ta i na</span></p><p begin="01:39.812" end="01:43.305" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">今夜最後だったらまた明日<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若今夜已至结尾 那便明天见吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko n ya sa i go da 't ta ra ma ta a shi ta</span></p><p begin="01:43.786" end="01:48.477" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">ええ何度も今日を繰り返すんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嗯 无数次将今天的美好重复</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">e e na n do mo kyo u wo ku ri ka e su n da</span></p><p begin="01:48.906" end="01:50.669" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">何千何万回だって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">成千上万次</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n ze n na n ma n ka i da 't te</span></p><p begin="01:51.126" end="01:52.956" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">貴方の指に触れたかった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都想触碰你的指尖</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta no yu bi ni fu re ta ka 't ta</span></p><p begin="01:53.365" end="01:55.228" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">何千何万回だって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">成千上万次</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n ze n na n ma n ka i da 't te</span></p><p begin="01:55.660" end="01:57.524" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">貴方の肩に凭れたいな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都想依靠着你的肩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta no ka ta ni mo ta re ta i na</span></p><p begin="01:57.883" end="02:01.416" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">平行線の今にも朝が来る<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使好似平行线的如今 清晨依旧会到来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">he i ko u se n no i ma ni mo a sa ga ku ru</span></p><p begin="02:01.917" end="02:05.091" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">ええ何度でも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是的 无论多少次</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">e e na n do de mo</span></p><p begin="02:24.321" end="02:27.745" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">回れ回れ春の夢<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">春之梦 旋转不休</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma wa re ma wa re ha ru no yu me</span></p><p begin="02:28.226" end="02:32.048" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">覚めないで一人はやめて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要醒来 不要再让我孑然一身</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa me na i de hi to ri wa ya me te</span></p><p begin="02:33.439" end="02:36.797" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">春風の孤独の果て<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">春风孤独的尽头</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha ru ka ze no ko do ku no ha te</span></p><p begin="02:37.259" end="02:41.487" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">つまらないな恐ろしいな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">穷极无聊 甚是可怕</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu ma ra na i na o so ro shi i na</span></p><p begin="02:43.271" end="02:45.114" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">燦々と満開だった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">樱花满开 绚烂如霞</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa n sa n to ma n ka i da 't ta</span></p><p begin="02:45.486" end="02:47.351" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">貴方の歌が聞こえるんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我听见了你的歌声</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta no u ta ga ki ko e ru n da</span></p><p begin="02:47.724" end="02:49.536" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">燦々と満開だった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">樱花满开 绚烂如霞</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa n sa n to ma n ka i da 't ta</span></p><p begin="02:50.041" end="02:51.852" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">貴方の春が始まるんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">属于你的春日就此开始</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta no ha ru ga ha ji ma ru n da</span></p><p begin="02:52.246" end="02:53.228" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">バイバイバイバイ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拜拜 拜拜</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ba i ba i ba i ba i</span></p><p begin="02:53.406" end="02:55.870" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">今夜もありがとさん<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今夜 不胜感激</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko n ya mo a ri ga to sa n</span></p><p begin="02:56.232" end="02:59.439" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">もう最後かな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">或许 这已是结局</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u sa i go ka na</span></p><p begin="03:00.537" end="03:02.282" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">楽しそうだった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">欢声笑语</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta no shi so u da 't ta</span></p><p begin="03:02.715" end="03:04.594" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">嬉しかったんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">恍惚远去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u re shi ka 't ta n da</span></p><p begin="03:04.968" end="03:06.763" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">笑えそうだった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">蓦然醒悟</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ra e so u da 't ta</span></p><p begin="03:07.267" end="03:11.442" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">進めそうだったと気がついたんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不再悲伤 不再停步</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su su me so u da 't ta to ki ga tsu i ta n da</span></p><p begin="03:14.145" end="03:15.795" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">またねまたね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再见 再见</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ta ne ma ta ne</span></p><p begin="03:16.330" end="03:19.637" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">まだ春を待つ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我仍静待春天</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma da ha ru wo ma tsu</span></p></div></body></tt>